# Cardano Midnight Claim Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and replace ALL placeholder values with your actual information

# CRITICAL: Replace with your actual seed phrase (12 or 24 words, space-separated)
# Example: word1 word2 word3 word4 word5 word6 word7 word8 word9 word10 word11 word12
TREZOR_SEED_PHRASE=your actual twelve or twenty four word mnemonic seed phrase goes here

# Replace with your actual passphrase (or leave completely empty if you don't use one)
# Example: MySecretPassphrase123
# Important: Leave completely empty (no quotes) if you don't use a passphrase
TREZOR_PASSPHRASE=

# Replace with your eligible Cardano address from Midnight Portal (the one with claim rights)
# This should be the EXACT address shown in your Midnight Portal eligibility
# Example: addr1qxk3cq8emwuusdlas04yn0qf3xndd6ts6ta7l3kh4vphuhss0y3k3y7r4ztz6xy0xjysj4j9ksysnlhnp0stqdwwyusq9g5th3
CLAIM_ADDRESS=

# Standard Trezor derivation path (Account 0 is most common)
# Account 0: m/1852'/1815'/0'/0/0 (most users)
# Account 1: m/1852'/1815'/1'/0/0
# Account 2: m/1852'/1815'/2'/0/0
# Change this only if you know your address is from a different account
PAYMENT_PATH=m/1852'/1815'/0'/0/0

# Replace with your actual stake key checksum (64 hex characters)
# This is the most critical piece of information for successful claiming
# Get this from Yoroi, AdaLite, or Cardano Explorer
# Example: a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789ab
STAKE_CHECKSUM=

# Key output directory. On Windows, create this directory first and restrict its
# ACL to the claiming user; Python mode bits do not provide that protection.
CLAIM_WORKSPACE=./cardano_claim_output

# Example complete configuration:
# TREZOR_SEED_PHRASE=abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon abandon about
# TREZOR_PASSPHRASE=
# CLAIM_ADDRESS=addr1qxk3cq8emwuusdlas04yn0qf3xndd6ts6ta7l3kh4vphuhss0y3k3y7r4ztz6xy0xjysj4j9ksysnlhnp0stqdwwyusq9g5th3
# PAYMENT_PATH=m/1852'/1815'/0'/0/0
# STAKE_CHECKSUM=a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789a1b2c3d4e5f6789ab
# CLAIM_WORKSPACE=./cardano_claim_output

# SECURITY REMINDERS:
# 1. This file contains your seed phrase - treat it as highly sensitive
# 2. Never commit this file to version control
# 3. Delete this file immediately after successful claiming
# 4. Only use this on your OLD wallet - never on your primary wallet with funds
# 5. Transfer all funds to a NEW wallet before running this script
# 6. Requires synced Cardano node for network communication
